  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the Phosphorus oxoacid can create silver mirror from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;solution?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The oxyacid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;has different structures based on the value of n. If n=3,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0047_5f2f0216da04.png\" style=\"width: 181px; height: 162px;\" /></p><p>The oxyacid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;has the following structure.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0047_9da4173ee9d6.png\" style=\"width: 237px; height: 129px;\" /></p><p>The structures of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0047_bf7e7c59c1ef.png\" style=\"width: 394px; height: 107px;\" /></p><p>Oxyacid having <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> bond can reduce <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;to<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ag</mi></math>. Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;can create silver mirror with silver nitrate.</p>"
  }
